          "short": "$(64+32\\pi)\\,\\mathrm{mm}^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}r&=8\\div2=4\\,\\mathrm{mm}\\\\A&=8^2+4\\left(\\frac12\\pi(4)^2\\right)\\\\A&=(64+32\\pi)\\,\\mathrm{mm}^2\\end{align*}$$",
